  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.04 Armed forces",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.04 “Armed forces” means “armed forces” as defined in RSA 21:50, II, and includes the armed forces of any of the governments associated with the United States in the wars, conflicts or armed conflicts, or combat zones in RSA 72:28.\n\nSource. #5911, eff 10-14-94; ss and moved by #7410, eff 11-23-00 (from Rev 401.05); (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 400) #9309, eff 10-30-08; ss by #12027, eff 10-28-16; ss by #13943-B, eff 4-27-24",
